  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A rectangular conducting coil rotates at a constant angular velocity in a uniform magnetic field. The rotation axis of the coil is perpendicular to the field.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>At one instant the plane of the coil is at an angle θ to the direction of the field.</p>\n<p>The magnitude of the emf induced in the coil is</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">never zero.</li><li data-label=\"B\">at a maximum when θ = 0° or 180°.</li><li data-label=\"C\">at a maximum when θ = 45° or 225°.</li><li data-label=\"D\">at a maximum when θ = 90° or 270°.</li></ol>"
  },
